msgstr "其他連線已接管此 Shell"

msgid "Branch: runs the “Then” steps if the “Target” (output since last send / whole screen / variable) contains the “Text to match”, and the “Else” steps if not. It checks right away without waiting, so to check a response, put a “Wait for Text” step before it."
msgstr "分支：若「目標」（上次傳送後的輸出 / 整個畫面 / 變數）包含「要比對的文字」，則執行「則」的步驟，否則執行「否則」的步驟。它會立即檢查而不等待，因此若要檢查回應，請在前面放置「等待字串」步驟。"

msgid "Branching on a value: set the branch's “Target” to “Variable” to check the value of that variable. A variable that has no value yet takes “Else”. Named groups of a regular expression can pull part of a value out into another variable."
msgstr "依值分支：將分支的「目標」設為「變數」，即可檢查該變數的值。尚未有值的變數會走「否則」。規則運算式的具名群組可將值的一部分擷取至另一個變數。"

msgid "Brings the shell back to this tab (the other connection is detached)"
