msgid "telnet was not found. Add “Telnet Client” from Windows “Optional features”, or run `Enable-WindowsOptionalFeature -Online -FeatureName TelnetClient` in PowerShell as an administrator."
msgstr "找不到 telnet。請從 Windows 的「選用功能」新增「Telnet 用戶端」，或以系統管理員身分在 PowerShell 中執行 `Enable-WindowsOptionalFeature -Online -FeatureName TelnetClient`。"

